1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,128
This is a demo,
and it's fifteen and a half gigabytes.

2
00:00:03,378 --> 00:00:05,409
Fifteen of those you download.

3
00:00:07,659 --> 00:00:14,052
It's Dragon Quest Monsters: The Withered World.
Befriend monsters, raise them, and fuse two into something new.

4
00:00:14,302 --> 00:00:19,023
The full game lands in December.
The demo lets you start the adventure now.

5
00:00:19,273 --> 00:00:23,629
It's in nine languages,
with online co-op and PvP already listed.

6
00:00:24,029 --> 00:00:27,209
Worth a dip,
if you've got fifteen gigabytes spare.

7
00:00:27,609 --> 00:00:31,077
That's Demo Dip.
A new Steam demo, every day.
